# Scope and remaining evidence

No live Walkie or Celly process restarted, no sandbox settings or queue edited.
This release addresses wake ownership conflicts; it does not claim to resolve
all user-reported turn interruptions. Separate investigation found repeated
upstream HTTP 400 service_tier validation errors; no provider-policy change is
included in this release. Actual rejected Walkie input id remains unknown;
11901 was the logged cursor, not proven to be the rejected input.
